WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
[Soft electronic music]
AppBuilder: from screen data to a living app.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Import QuickDrop's six screens, validate the structure,
and save the project.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Open the spec sheet for supported widgets,
screen schemas, and property contracts.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Inspect the widget tree and the hierarchy
behind every layout.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Edit text, font size, and colour.
The canvas updates as the properties change.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Six connected screens: Login, Home, Restaurant,
Cart, Order Tracking, and Profile.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.600
Click Launch Preview to run the real Flutter app.

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:33.000
Flutter compiles the application.
The compilation wait has been edited out.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:37.000
The interactive Flutter delivery app
is running inside the builder.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Open a restaurant, browse its menu,
and tap Add to cart to see the app respond.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:51.000
View the cart, place the order,
and see the order confirmation.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Continue to Order Tracking for delivery status
and rider details.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:00.000
AppBuilder: your next idea, ready to build.
Visual control and a real Flutter preview.
